<https://fair-systemdynamics.github.io/fair-hunter-prey-simulation/semantic/#term/ratio-of-actual-to-required-biomass> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Ratio of Actual to Required Biomass" ;
    dcterms:description "Measures how much forage is available, relative to what is needed to sustain the current deer population. Values below 1 indicate a shortage of forage biomass." ;
